    "email": "",
    "photo_path": "img/board/hazel.webp",
    "bio": "Hi everyone! My name is Hazel Ortega, and I am the treasurer for CSS, and major is Computer Science. A tiny bit about myself, I worked for two years at LaGuardia as a teacher assistant. This summer of 2023 I taught Introduction To Coding for teenagers around 14-15 years old, and were able to create their own application using different tools and methods used while I was teaching Python. It was a fun summer. Also, my favorite food is ramen!",
