    "bio": "Hi! I have been the President of the club since June 2021. We have an amazing team here at the CSS Club. I was in charge of leading the club into new levels, like having our first CUNY-wide John Jay Hackathon, growing from 40 members to 540+ members, creating the Club's Website, and having new workshops like React, Python, Swift, MySQL, Git/GitHub, Technical Interview Prep, Javascript, Career Prep , HTML/CSS, Cybersecurity topics, and creating new Assistant Exec Positions, as well as the Web Developer, Data Analytics, Photographer, and Journalist roles.",
    "socials": {
